The redraw command isn't used much, but it's not really a command in
that it has no game function; your character doesn't do anything, it's
a command to the game.  Also, it causes no game time to pass, so one
can use it indefinitely without penalty.

The least-used "active" command may be #sit, which isn't useful for
much other than sitting on thrones.

The most-used active command, other than the movement keys and
metakeys, is probably comma, the pick-up command.  (Unless you have
auto-pickup turned on, but anymore it seems like that's a recipe for
disaster.)

